{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a616ecf2b07c2a2b5c473bd769a2020b799d7f0d068a562f1dee15c2ae7a6022", "ja": "低学年向けの番組に、お姉さんゲストとして\n出演する育。海外に引っ越しする子のお別れ\nパーティーで色紙を渡すが泣かれてしまい、\n自己満足だったかもしれないと反省。彼女と\n最後の思い出を作ろうとする。", "zh": "育作为大姐姐嘉宾出演面向低年级的\n电视节目。在即将搬到海外的孩子其告别\n派对上送了签名板，对方却哭了起来，\n育反省自己是不是太自我感动了。她决定\n要和那个孩子一起留下最后的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f29ae6d1c4c60d3789611cb2d8794d36b2168ef397b3080563d029e98d6d183f", "ja": "（今日は『小学生わいわいわーい！』の収録日。\nスタジオに向かう前に、育と色紙を買いに来た）", "zh": "（今天是《小学生欢欢闹闹！》的录制日。去摄影棚之前，和育一起来买留言板。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "04a5f2b487bd3482d9b5d369732e2fcdf4c51eb332aae0bde624b77851c2d323", "ja": "わぁ、かわいいネコ！\nこっちは風船、お花……。", "zh": "哇，好可爱的小猫！\n这边是气球、花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "d49b28f113e63187e3a8885b7c08442b539fd46cf79544e57d197c66ee92df13", "ja": "どれもステキだけど……りーふちゃんだし、\n葉っぱがあるといいんだけど……？", "zh": "每样都很棒，不过毕竟是小叶，要是有叶子就好了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7a2c00707696a45eef41fef51e77d1eb946de4c72a27ca6d6f83d3ee6124990e", "ja": "色紙にも色々あるんだな。\nこっちはデコ用のシールに、ふくらむペン……？", "zh": "原来色纸也有各种各样的啊。这边是装饰用贴纸，还有立体笔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "154a5673e0c64f619612b43bba1b33edf3610eb2f1f84f39668ad52ae8b8b7e6", "ja": "うん……決めた！　これにしよっと♪\n{$P$}さん、買ってくるね！", "zh": "嗯……决定了！就选这个吧♪\n{$P$}先生，我去买喽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fcced74210ce16e0bcb4c95d00509ff1865ea7dc739cc53f6c801305db661143", "ja": "ああ、うん。\nここで待ってるよ！", "zh": "啊，好。\n我就在这里等你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "52077dc6366632ae09550dbbf84213332e6a3d0156089219e8494386c5e6bbb4", "ja": "{$P$}さん、みてみて！\n色紙のメッセージ、たくさん集まったよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，快看快看！\n签名板上的留言，收集到好多哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6a471fda81e606cf5ada599af6180e42d1949de605e37be2d1ee0f4600980f6d", "ja": "本当だ。\nみんな、たくさん書いてくれたんだな。", "zh": "确实。\n大家都写了好多啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "1b83062cb74c14a0a847299236e083f5c2edec7b74a18b7623858ee17fc04120", "ja": "でも、きょう来てない子もいるから……\n次の収録で、全員そろうと思うんだ。", "zh": "不过，也有些人今天没来……\n我想下次录制时，大家就能到齐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "747874eea4411ad5c36411e93a1e5eb267934eaca4f8af6bb24eeb628e46b80f", "ja": "お別れパーティーまでに、\nみんなに書いてもらわなくちゃ！", "zh": "在告别派对之前，\n必须让大家都写好才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f2ae79a9c41f9b1844e73651be70350fa5d94273fb0ca7440a0504002167c554", "ja": "育、張り切ってるな。", "zh": "育，干劲十足啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "39e5c2e2321d65ef73bbc7d82e3cc0cb2b14e9c41d71eff0e325c810a5dc744e", "ja": "うん。このげんばでは、\nわたしがいちばんの年上でしょ？", "zh": "嗯。因为在这个现场，\n我是年纪最大的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "d1e81cd46785039fd70141bcccba75c1e6c0e7df75d31cde7af9eccbef69d41d", "ja": "それに、りーふちゃんのためだもん。\nちゃんとしきらないとね！", "zh": "而且，这也是为了里夫嘛。得好好主持才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1013_rifu", "source_sha256": "405810941a1403ab957e2de66e8d3ecbcb5100c2ec2bc5c42479657e54a11820", "ja": "……育ちゃん。\n……。", "zh": "……育。\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "dd2efa389236ae295b182bcea601177c4f642cd2db37877d734f9e58f37d8df8", "ja": "あっ、り、りーふちゃん！\n……{$P$}さん、持ってて！", "zh": "啊，莉、莉芙！……{$P$}先生，拿着！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1015_p", "source_sha256": "244f18c80958efa36be7ca975d0cac4480852e314dc1eb4cccc3ef063febd719", "ja": "あ、ああ。\n……。", "zh": "啊，嗯。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "4988034870c27af43d78678583e066e892a79d75aa001ddac2473ef980d78580", "ja": "えっと、どうかした？", "zh": "那个，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1017_rifu", "source_sha256": "6f1fecc699e9ed761f0ac553390e1f6a22f35082564fbf8c232659e441f37d70", "ja": "……。\nやっぱり、なんでもない……。", "zh": "……。\n还是算了，没什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "36f9e81e19584757fd919184a6d70b8ea5b841b967f760a0f24bc0a87acc7350", "ja": "えっ、そう？　……りーふちゃん、\nみんなのところに行かなくていいの？", "zh": "咦，是吗？……莉芙，你不用去大家那边吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1019_rifu", "source_sha256": "ab8afa1e6eef71400247236d242a6d3af58ca48f0c681c15618a101f6e115b98", "ja": "……。\n行く……。", "zh": "……。\n去……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "ba1fe00cffd9eb4124b172534833aa2c8d45c2d228b1b78b29b1ab7366864176", "ja": "う、うん！\nまたあとでね！", "zh": "嗯、嗯！\n待会儿见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "217fbe2db3ae81c8d6a594fcb92e614ba903bf117093eeae846f34294fee106f", "ja": "び、びっくりした～！　{$P$}さん、\n色紙、りーふちゃんに見られなかったよね？", "zh": "吓、吓了一跳～！{$P$}先生，签名板没被小叶看到吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1023_p", "source_sha256": "206dcb6777335a02e994d81de8754b0142040ae5fa452890efa24fec4eef6b7d", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫だと思う。それより、\nりーふちゃんだけど……なんだか元気がないな。", "zh": "啊，我觉得应该没事。比起那个，里夫她……总觉得没什么精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1024_030iku", "source_sha256": "53a771c60d97f66b78b0189a341255866a54fb8baa06e20606d50679b8fb8c01", "ja": "うん……そうだね。\nいつもは、もっと元気なんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。\n平时她明明更精神的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1025_030iku", "source_sha256": "0408167eb0376317e3df12ee0fe0fb8aa290244f09dadb7468a58a9052622765", "ja": "やっぱり、引っ越すのがさみしいのかな……。", "zh": "果然，还是舍不得搬家吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1026_p", "source_sha256": "e3dd67a2c4dea6cb601cea620ade4555176e2c47e6a9dbbf8b6394e62f54ae25", "ja": "（育はその後も、色紙に寄せ書きを集め続け……\nいよいよ、お別れパーティー当日がやってきた）", "zh": "（那之后，育还在继续收集大家写在留言板上的寄语……终于，送别派对的这一天到来了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1027_p", "source_sha256": "e757f0c2bcdc0a7ff6b26c118ce537a62019ee910bbf50dab18eed7dab8381ca", "ja": "（撮影後、スタジオにはテーブルが置かれ、\nケーキやお菓子、ジュースが並べられた）", "zh": "（拍摄结束后，摄影棚里摆上了桌子，蛋糕、点心和果汁也都摆好了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1028_staff", "source_sha256": "764e82f5753d68284e1a92c696f6b8c4dd9ff675fd2d0908855d554c35c9e551", "ja": "それじゃあ、ケーキを切り分けるね。\n順番に並んでくださーい。", "zh": "那么，我来把蛋糕切开分给大家。\n请按顺序排好队——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1029_ou", "source_sha256": "abf88a52f39246393b83843836c5fbf9a390c06360e2559e951dbae479229da9", "ja": "はーい！　おれたべる！", "zh": "好——！我来吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1030_seira1", "source_sha256": "13b03dcca8f737b52723e1aafbee8cb2acb3a60851b53ca22b78a8e13b085d36", "ja": "わたしがさきだよー！", "zh": "我先来哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1031_ou", "source_sha256": "8b5599cd70dd9e7f1ff9f24b07faaebb1c6a4a3e59fc06fde2a7e55afdea5863", "ja": "ねえ、おれのおさらないんだけど！", "zh": "喂，我的盘子不见了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1032_seira1", "source_sha256": "1b8f0835969383564ca0bbaa6b8a4a730b989ec428bd57e7c57c45508ed7e2e1", "ja": "あっ、育ちゃん！　こんど、育ちゃんの\nライブがみられるって、ほんとう？", "zh": "啊，育！听说这次能看到你的演唱会，是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1033_030iku", "source_sha256": "a92a4219822698d236c44abf0f7fc5ab59f85a7909335713fb6b020acc150add", "ja": "うん！　みんなを招待していいよって、\n{$P$}さんが！", "zh": "嗯！是{$P$}先生说可以邀请大家来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1034_seira1", "source_sha256": "d0c81e1c76b21964b01c22bcee0ddbfeac69a3e40fc07da8408b674e4d313432", "ja": "わぁ～、たのしみ！", "zh": "哇～，好期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1035_ou", "source_sha256": "de2d19d3b6ca0ab8fa696a5b91f6c89f074c686f4ba1bc2aa56cfbe59865d97f", "ja": "おれ、ライブとかはじめて！", "zh": "我还是第一次参加演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1037_030iku", "source_sha256": "d3e108674ca94a98459b8d7ebf3f1b7410bd1592e9328c1f1bd5a10f2976a95f", "ja": "りーふちゃん、スタッフさんがケーキ切ってくれたよ！\nいっしょに食べよう？", "zh": "小莉芙，工作人员帮我们把蛋糕切好啦！\n一起吃吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1038_rifu", "source_sha256": "0050bbb3ec0d23c605b4fca9d1e0d341d07f55532702d80ad447da2ac23d34ca", "ja": "……。\nいらない……。", "zh": "……。\n不需要……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1039_030iku", "source_sha256": "cfd2bb74ff7cb875107fa9ed89fb8833b2274b4b7dfc62b93b34a7bc1aa5d85b", "ja": "え？　でもりーふちゃんの好きな、イチゴの\nショートケーキだよ？　くまさんも乗ってるし……。", "zh": "诶？可是这是小莉芙喜欢的草莓奶油蛋糕哦？上面还放着小熊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1041_p", "source_sha256": "ec3a2ee339fbd96974becc45c50c8b376773361ce0a5c056cfdba8612ce605f4", "ja": "（今日の主役は、りーふちゃんだけど……。\n内容がお別れ会じゃ、元気がないのも無理もないな）", "zh": "（今天的主角虽然是小莉芙……\n可内容却是欢送会，她没精神也是情有可原）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1042_staff", "source_sha256": "2bd8c5e999d167be134741dfc697b117389e75fef7bffdc003427c3d391304f1", "ja": "楽しかった会も、そろそろ終わりです。さて、\n最後にりーふちゃんに、プレゼントがあるそうですよ！", "zh": "愉快的聚会也差不多要结束了。那么，听说最后还有一份礼物要送给里夫哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1043_staff", "source_sha256": "07e7017a4be778a6690e6e5ab24accd5fee22f514b225eb29157d94e9e3444f5", "ja": "みんなを代表して……\n育ちゃん、お願いします！", "zh": "代表大家……\n小育，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1044_030iku", "source_sha256": "1eb3f726cc19794dc2a5a1ab060a4026bb017cf63cea3ecd370f01a5e74af9dd", "ja": "はい！\n……りーふちゃん。この色紙、みんなから！", "zh": "好的！\n……莉芙，这张签名板是大家送给你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1046_030iku", "source_sha256": "2a30bc3e3535482e9977eca2490e23d6ac22d3a43c5c14098512191cd0c102f2", "ja": "みんなで、お別れのメッセージを書いたんだ。\n海外に行っても、元気でねって……。", "zh": "大家一起写了告别寄语。\n就算去了国外，也要保重身体哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1047_030iku", "source_sha256": "e6b045f294131ade31b0c83afbdfac496a92781eb8f172850fb4ee593c8c5321", "ja": "わたしは、じゅんレギュラーの間だけだったけど。\nりーふちゃんとお話しできて、楽しかったよ！", "zh": "虽然我只当了一阵子的准固定嘉宾。\n不过能和小莉芙聊天，真的很开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1048_rifu", "source_sha256": "19ff09371013c65021afe62f8108494b3290d150868bc2f5f856ab7cc2e19489", "ja": "い……いらないっ！\nプレゼントなんて、いらないもんっ！", "zh": "不……不要！\n我才不要什么礼物！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1049_030iku", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1050_rifu", "source_sha256": "81139282b292f359f526b47fc912e6a7cc23a39894563e487de2f71ef9d4b134", "ja": "だって、だって……\n色紙をもらったら、さいごになっちゃう……。", "zh": "因为、因为……\n要是拿到了签名板，就要结束了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1051_rifu", "source_sha256": "aad4d0dd98165d2dd9d63343c20d0da274c1b1d83ed0c9d3786f1adbace8255c", "ja": "わたし、ひっこしたくない……。\n外国になんか行きたくないもん……ふぇ～ん……。", "zh": "我不想搬家……\n我才不想去什么外国嘛……呜呜～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1052_staff", "source_sha256": "83470c761e0bc0859bdcc05b42329364925df8a09abeeb3b007467cf27a273f2", "ja": "あらあら、りーふちゃん泣かないで～。\nこの色紙、育ちゃんがみんなの分、集めてくれたのよ。", "zh": "哎呀哎呀，里芙，不要哭啦～  \n这张签名板是育帮大家收集来的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1053_rifu", "source_sha256": "08490819cfcc25d198999cb1d7ea82886a0951218beb136c10264ddbcf645813", "ja": "いらない、いらないもん……。\nうぇ～ん……。", "zh": "不要，才不要呢……\n呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1054_030iku", "source_sha256": "8437134aca10e06d64c844d0fc45bf62ec5cf7a3a6c93c238f84144983714ad1", "ja": "りーふちゃん……。", "zh": "莉芙……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1055_030iku", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1056_p", "source_sha256": "807f1a57688caeab413305f3240102e5aabd11b5c9a6abe0091f4d84cef274d6", "ja": "育……\nそんなに落ち込まなくても大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "育……别这么沮丧，没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1057_p", "source_sha256": "e4ad6c7d6e9ff40f670a052cb8ca13d1d7571890e4fd23170521429073772a48", "ja": "りーふちゃんも、今は寂しいだろうけど……\n落ち着いたら、色紙を喜んでくれるさ。", "zh": "莉芙现在也一定很寂寞吧……  \n不过等她平静下来后，一定会为这张签名板感到高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1058_030iku", "source_sha256": "4f8d92496166dce46769af71f141aafa2d9c3cf505a7d21c25e9405b8e40c7b1", "ja": "うん。でも……。\n色紙とか、わたしのじこまんぞくだったかも。", "zh": "嗯。但是……\n签名板之类的，也许只是我的自我感动而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1059_p", "source_sha256": "6caa71aaa190e0425aabbc6c8c651eb9c388f79351816b210ba936708347f994", "ja": "え！？\nそんな事はないと思うけど……。", "zh": "欸！？\n我觉得不是那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1060_030iku", "source_sha256": "2915ce004f184693e09744e7778d0aeb274839f10ba1d8f03783ad7b2f067b24", "ja": "でも……{$P$}さんは、\nりーふちゃんが元気がないって気が付いてたでしょ。", "zh": "可是……你不是已经注意到，{$P$}先生没什么精神了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1061_030iku", "source_sha256": "bc05a7b983a1c70c5489ed132f94e9778e5980c11426c1e50067fd552ddebc34", "ja": "あのときも、わたし……どっちかっていうと、\n色紙のことで頭がいっぱいだったかも。", "zh": "那个时候，我也……真要说起来的话，\n满脑子可能都只有签名板的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1062_030iku", "source_sha256": "8c0ff0642194535d83ba2b4ee8096776c56e2e6d94474fb7b75bac8354e7e40b", "ja": "りーふちゃんの気持ちも考えないで……\nそんなの、ぜんぜんダメだよね……。", "zh": "完全没考虑莉芙的心情……\n那样做，根本就不行吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1063_p", "source_sha256": "e4a62f4910a16139f34859559abe3031b9ca4533b0569ab1e3bfc9346c7c796d", "ja": "……それでも、育やみんなが色紙を送った事は、\n間違いじゃなかったと思うよ。", "zh": "……即便如此，我觉得育和大家送色纸这件事，\n并没有做错哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1064_p", "source_sha256": "e67a27f211604c6de6c916b8d21e2aacde91c7d74c361ddabf064c7bbfca7f87", "ja": "後は、そうだな……。引っ越しまでの間、できるだけ\nりーふちゃんと過ごす時間を作るといいんじゃないか？", "zh": "还有，我想想……在搬家之前，尽量\n多抽些时间陪陪莉芙，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1065_p", "source_sha256": "2c4c5cf522f015d5933d9861b09e888868c352214f0bfda241c86925b6c99524", "ja": "たくさん話して、思い出を作るのはどうだ？", "zh": "多聊聊天，创造一些回忆怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1066_030iku", "source_sha256": "87ad56a868d7405de056315417f56647fc7c5df3ecdffe6b3286a0520f57aa28", "ja": "うん……そうする。\n{$P$}さん、ありがとう……。", "zh": "嗯……就这么办。\n{$P$}先生，谢谢你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1067_029umi", "source_sha256": "a2a824bae0275503652ff4c3d68acb619801560ed05df6f49607b211752eba63", "ja": "ねえねえ、どう？　この振り付け！\n楽しいカンジ、伝わるかな！？", "zh": "喂喂，怎么样？这段舞蹈动作！\n能感受到那种快乐的感觉吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1068_042miy", "source_sha256": "d5892f5b58b953e801d110f72bc39c04806cadda8f35f3f4343eb532ffa7a2e8", "ja": "おお～。海美ちゃん、とっても楽しそうですね～。\n私もなんだか、踊りたくなってきましたよ～。", "zh": "哇哦～海美，看起来特别开心呢～  \n我也不知不觉想跳舞了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1069_009rit", "source_sha256": "74d52eb6554c69479b84566a54b4854be09db51a11ae991b549477c1c9da8ee1", "ja": "ちょっと海美？　その場のノリで振り付けを変えると、\n後で覚えられなくなって困るわよ？", "zh": "海美，你等一下？要是凭一时兴起改变编舞，之后可就记不住了，会很麻烦的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1070_024ann", "source_sha256": "45c049f2358e7208ed2728ad4e101e8022d58f38b7a356e48cd20fa39128687a", "ja": "でも今の、覚えゲーみたいだったよね！？　右右左右、\nななめ、ななめ、くるっと回って……イェーイ！", "zh": "不过刚才那个，感觉就像记忆游戏一样吧！？右右左右，斜着，斜着，转个圈……耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1071_009rit", "source_sha256": "84bf132b6530aae83147ec3eb6daf5b4a2317c12aa221ea17541240806ac503a", "ja": "杏奈も乗り気なの！？\nはぁ……仕方ない、やりますか！", "zh": "连杏奈也很有干劲吗！？\n唉……没办法，那就做吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1072_029umi", "source_sha256": "83640cab5d6e8ee838338670878ac513c8d0699a9f1214738883f6fa2895e0db", "ja": "採用やったーーーっ！\n大丈夫、そんなに難しくないよ☆", "zh": "采纳啦——！\n没问题，没那么难哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1073_p", "source_sha256": "cf096ad07d7881c61568bd46f1c7396df48a166bee00819f5b17b8d0d8a902a4", "ja": "みんながいいならいいけど……\n後で、振り付けの先生にも確認しておいてくれよ！", "zh": "只要大家都同意就行，不过……\n之后也记得向编舞老师确认一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1074_024ann", "source_sha256": "4226c9835de958c1860a77db68ac128fa3915694adce54966c61ebb645070211", "ja": "はーい！／はい～。", "zh": "好——！／好～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1075_042miy", "source_sha256": "259b1273383b0bdb6edb79df720a6038b50ad1640d625fdd6249182573293172", "ja": "はい～。", "zh": "是～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1076_p", "source_sha256": "879626a72ca75b31efc9a17e88b9d6c3dd79ae785e9b0e4150cee1863633eb0b", "ja": "（定期公演の練習は、順調に進んでいる。\nあとは……）", "zh": "（定期公演的练习进展得很顺利。接下来只要……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1077_se", "source_sha256": "87e635fd0d100f0fbbd5243bd40b01894e9976e8c04c32bfc008a2e2a25d0c8d", "ja": "バタバタバタ……バタン！", "zh": "啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1078_030iku", "source_sha256": "97f60da88c43bb5521afaac60209b060170acfcd354ddae40c0a8235645b4576", "ja": "おつかれさまです！\nおそくなりました！", "zh": "辛苦了！\n我来晚了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1079_042miy", "source_sha256": "602d2bdd4100f420d76b49cd90864391994ba37dc7ae3686353f7ff9618b6fa1", "ja": "育ちゃん、お疲れさまです～。", "zh": "小育，辛苦啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
