{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1081_030iku", "source_sha256": "34ed6ffb71d825aa4febb67f65c7e3e1687500d3aa52eba4737a3596079fce42", "ja": "ほんとう？\nよかったぁ。", "zh": "真的吗？\n太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1082_030iku", "source_sha256": "854b99d53ef0b39fe95217d35ee27b8270bb1c94914595a542058b1c800b5cbd", "ja": "あっ、レッスンの前に……{$P$}さん\nこれ見て！　りーふちゃんから！", "zh": "啊，训练之前……{$P$}先生\n快看这个！是莉芙发来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1083_p", "source_sha256": "ab5da9c8e58c66f03b629e030827bef6bc8b5b04d9508c97614a9db4f3669ae8", "ja": "りーふちゃんからのメッセージか？\n……おお？　なんか、すごい長文だな……？", "zh": "是小叶子发来的消息吗？\n……哦？好像是好长一段话啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1084_030iku", "source_sha256": "07f214fcf1bcf1bef956a1c5e21860ab625a1fd562cc2ac19654e02358dcf676", "ja": "うん！　あのね、りーふちゃん、\nアニメが好きなんだって。", "zh": "嗯！那个啊，莉芙说她喜欢动画。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
