{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_163_1086_030iku", "source_sha256": "83f6f3a3e455e247ece479293c67fb7b559403d672f7475304c1c876e77276c1", "ja": "すっごく面白いって！\nもう20話までみちゃったって♪", "zh": "说特别有意思！已经看到第20集了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
